        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: J. P. Doherty, Debbie Harry, Cyndi Lauper\n- Tours: True Colors tour, Necessary Evil tour\n- Products: Necessary Evil\n- Bands: Blondie\n\nFacts:\n- Deborah Ann Harry was born Angela Tremble on July 1, 1945.\n- Debbie Harry is an American singer-songwriter and actress.\n- Debbie Harry is best known as the lead singer of the new wave band Blondie.\n- In June 2007, J. P. Doherty toured with Debbie Harry on Cyndi Lauper's True Colors tour.\n- In November and December 2007, J. P. Doherty toured with Debbie Harry on the Necessary Evil tour.\n- The Necessary Evil tour supported Debbie Harry's 2007 release \"Necessary Evil\".",
